<body><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p role="heading" aria-level="3" style="margin: 18.7333px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px;">Understanding </span><span style="margin: 0px;">Not-Knowing</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">One </span><span style="margin: 0px">possible outcome</span><span style="margin: 0px"> is the realization that there is no shared solution to the specific problem, which can be disappointing. H</span><span style="margin: 0px">owever</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">this</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">can</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">also</span><span style="margin: 0px"> offer </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> opportunity </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> take a step back, </span><span style="margin: 0px">redefine</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">problem</span><span style="margin: 0px">, and </span><span style="margin: 0px">examine</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> system in </span><span style="margin: 0px">which</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">problem</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">arose</span><span style="margin: 0px">. </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">This</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">may</span><span style="margin: 0px"> lead </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">further</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">questions</span><span style="margin: 0px"> or </span><span style="margin: 0px">reveal</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">other</span><span style="margin: 0px"> issues </span><span style="margin: 0px">that</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">need</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">be</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">addressed</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">before</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">tackling</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">chosen</span><span style="margin: 0px"> complex </span><span style="margin: 0px">problem</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p role="heading" aria-level="3" style="margin: 18.7333px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">Understanding Multiple </span><span style="margin: 0px">Perspectives</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Another </span><span style="margin: 0px">possible outcome</span><span style="margin: 0px"> is gaining insight into different perspectives on the same issue (Oonk et al., 2022). </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">This</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">can</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">be</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">achieved</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">by</span><span style="margin: 0px"> collaborating </span><span style="margin: 0px">with</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">people</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">from</span><span style="margin: 0px"> different disciplines, sectors, </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px">/or </span><span style="margin: 0px">cultural</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">backgrounds</span><span style="margin: 0px">. </span><span style="margin: 0px">In </span><span style="margin: 0px">doing</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">so</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">boundaries</span><span style="margin: 0px"> are </span><span style="margin: 0px">crossed</span><span style="margin: 0px">. </span><span style="margin: 0px">It </span><span style="margin: 0px">also</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">provides</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">an</span><span style="margin: 0px"> opportunity </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">reflect</span><span style="margin: 0px"> on </span><span style="margin: 0px">your</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">own</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">perspective</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;Questions like: </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">How do I view the problem?</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">This</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">helps</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">define</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">your</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">own</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">position</span><span style="margin: 0px"> and </span><span style="margin: 0px">understand</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">complexity</span><span style="margin: 0px"> of multiple viewpoints.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">You</span><span style="margin: 0px"> are </span><span style="margin: 0px">now</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">aware</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">that</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">outcome</span><span style="margin: 0px"> of a </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">collaboration</span><span style="margin: 0px"> is </span><span style="margin: 0px">not</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">just</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">innovative</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">idea</span><span style="margin: 0px"> or “product” </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> team </span><span style="margin: 0px">comes</span><span style="margin: 0px"> up </span><span style="margin: 0px">with</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">To</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">avoid</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">disappointment</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">among</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">students</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">educators</span><span style="margin: 0px">, or stakeholders, </span><span style="margin: 0px">expectations</span><span style="margin: 0px"> must </span><span style="margin: 0px">be</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">carefully</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">managed</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">from</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> start.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></span></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">Reference</span><span style="margin: 0px">:</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Oonk, C., </span><span style="margin: 0px">Gulikers</span><span style="margin: 0px">, J., den Brok, P., &amp; Mulder, M. (2022). </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-style: italic; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Stimulating</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">boundary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> crossing </span><span style="margin: 0px">learning</span><span style="margin: 0px"> in a </span><span style="margin: 0px">multi</span><span style="margin: 0px">-stakeholder </span><span style="margin: 0px">learning</span><span style="margin: 0px"> environment </span><span style="margin: 0px">for</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">sustainable</span><span style="margin: 0px"> development</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">. </span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-style: italic; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">International Journal of </span><span style="margin: 0px">Sustainability</span><span style="margin: 0px"> in </span><span style="margin: 0px">Higher</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Education</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">, 23(8), 21–40.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></body>
